erating voltage across it does not exceed its rated 75V limit. For circuits subject to high-voltage transients or spikes, you should use transient voltage suppressors (TVS diodes) or choose a specialized surge-resistant resistor to protect the component."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/b426be3ce22c6de3e0c3a2248e49159e.pdf?productCode=C98220","authenticationList":["ROHS3 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS3","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1598927","fileName":"YAGEO(国巨)_贴片电容_X6S系列_ROHS认证.pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/7231f3cca6980a4791d39cd2bf4e90cb.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1831512","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_YAGEO(国巨).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/880d4dd55fe33a5c283e5964fb88da1d.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1851664","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_YAGEO(国巨)@@Brightking(君耀电子).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/b66f8cddf95c82a86c072e3fb0621167.pdf"}],"productDescEn":null,"productIntroEn":"100mW 10kΩ 75V Thick Film Resistor ±100ppm/℃ ±1% 0603 Chip Resistor - Surface Mount RoHS","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_10837_n","paramName":"功率","paramNameEn":"Power(Watts)","paramValue":"100mW","paramValueEn":"100mW","paramValueEnForSearch":0.1,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":20},{"paramCode":"param_11205_n","paramName":"阻值","paramNameEn":"Resistance","paramValue":"10kΩ","paramValueEn":"10kΩ","paramValueEnForSearch":10000.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":7},{"paramCode":"param_11204_n","paramName":"最大工作电压","paramNameEn":"Voltage Rating","paramValue":"75V","paramValueEn":"75V","paramValueEnForSearch":75.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":18},{"paramCode":"param_11202","paramName":"电阻类型","paramNameEn":"Type","paramValue":"厚膜电阻","paramValueEn":"Thick Film Resistor","paramValueEnForSearch":-1.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":1},{"paramCode":"param_11185_s","paramName":"温度系数","paramNameEn":"Temperature Coefficient","paramValue":"±100ppm/℃","paramValueEn":"±100ppm/℃","paramValueEnF